l mortgage-backed securities (RMBS) in the United States. The company's RMBS is backed by single-family residential mortgage loans, referred to as Agency RMBS. Its portfolio comprises traditional pass-through Agency RMBS, such as mortgage pass through certificates and collateralized mortgage obligations; and structured Agency RMBS, including interest only securities, inverse interest only securities, and principal only securities. The company has elected to be taxed as a real estate investment trust (REIT) for the United States federal income tax purposes. As a result, it would not be subject to corporate income tax on that portion of its net income that is distributed to stockholders, if it annually distributes dividends equal to at least 90% of its REIT taxable income to its shareholders. Orchid Island Capital, Inc. was incorporated in 2010 and is headquartered in Vero Beach, Florida.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Robert E. Cauley C.F.A., CPA | Chairman, President & CEO | Age 67","culture_narrative":"Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (5/10).","financial_summary":["Orchid Island Capital, Inc. is a small-cap real estate business with a $953M market cap.","On the balance sheet, thin 0.6\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.0) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Payout ratio looks stretched \u2014 the dividend\u2019s own margin of safety is thin","sev":"red","cat":"dividend"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 9.8% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Real Estate peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Interest-rate sensitivity and tenant-credit risk \u2014 cap rates and refinancing costs move faster than the 10-year leases can absorb.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Remote work structural vacancy \u2014 the post-pandemic shift to hybrid work has permanently impaired demand for urban office space across most markets.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Climate and insurance cost escalation \u2014 rising premiums and coverage withdrawals in flood/fire zones are repricing assets that the market once treated as perpetuities.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 49% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","12 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Real Estate sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Orchid Island Capital (NYSE:ORC) and WhiteHorse Finance (NASDAQ:WHF) Head to Head Survey","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/10/30/orchid-island-capital-nyseorc-and-whitehorse-finance-nasdaqwhf-head-to-head-survey.html","date":"2026-10-30","timestamp":1793365126.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.893,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"(ORC) Risk Channels and Responsive Allocation","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/151/ORC_Risk_Channels_and_Responsive_Allocation_102926044002_1793306402.html","date":"2026-10-29","timestamp":1793306402.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.202,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Orchid Island Capital: 3 Key Takeaways for Long-Term Investors","source":"finan